WEBVTT

00:00:29.065 --> 00:00:31.184
imate ove ogromne oblake prašne.

00:00:31.184 --> 00:00:32.949
I želim da obratite posebnu pažnju

00:00:32.949 --> 00:00:34.399
na tri mala kraka

00:00:34.399 --> 00:00:36.300
u cenrtu slike.

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:37.715
Ako ih pažljivo pogledate,

00:00:37.715 --> 00:00:39.368
izgledaju ovako.

00:00:39.368 --> 00:00:42.218
I to što vidite su stubovi prašine

00:00:42.218 --> 00:00:44.265
u kojima ima toliko prašine -

00:00:44.265 --> 00:00:48.598
inače, ova skala ima bilion vertikalnih milja -

00:00:48.598 --> 00:00:51.516
i tu je toliko prašine,

00:00:51.516 --> 00:00:53.450
da se ona spaja

00:00:53.450 --> 00:00:56.909
i usijava do termonuklearne reakcije.

00:00:56.909 --> 00:00:57.751
I ono što gledate

00:00:57.751 --> 00:00:59.736
jeste rođenje zvezda.

00:00:59.736 --> 00:01:01.393
Ovo su zvezde koje su rođene tamo.